proved deltas","the ownership gate (C1) must pass on the real tree with an empty legacy-exception set and no path-glob exceptions before RP-04 is considered complete","rollback must retain only the S1 snapshot-envelope compatibility floor; stored ticket/event/bridge/binding formats remain unchanged"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787309194961262001,"uuid":"d396ecea-eafb-4e66-bdca-d10db9320d04"}